[43.980568, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll start by inspecting the Python installation, pip configuration, and filesystem state to identify why package installation fails.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd && ls -la && echo '--- which python/pip ---' && which -a python python3 pip pip3 2>&1 || true && echo '--- versions ---' && python3 --version 2>&1; pip \r\n--version 2>&1; pip3 --version 2>&1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
