[88.229416, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe end-to-end local wheel install, import, metadata lookup, and uninstall all succeeded. I'll run final health checks across all pip entry points and verify \r\npip's own modules compile cleanly, then clean up nothing further.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nhash -r\r\necho '--- entry points ---'\r\npip --version\r\npip3 --version\r\npython3 -m pip --version\r\necho '--- pip module compile check ---'\r\npython3 -m compileall -q /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pip\r\necho 'pip modules compiled successfully'\r\necho '--- pip check ---'\r\npython3 -m pip check\r\necho '--- installed packages ---'\r\npython3 -m pip list --format=freeze\r\necho '--- no verification leftovers ---'\r\ntest ! -e /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/testpkg\r\ntest ! -e /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/testpkg-0.0.1.dist-info\r\necho 'clean'\r\n```\r\n"]
[88.229423, "o", "\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
